				"string" : "Standardize all MCP tool parameters that reference Lepiter UUIDs (page and database) to use **string36 format** consistently, and add `pageId` / `databaseId` optional parameters to all page-referencing tools for unambiguous lookup."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
