				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## Problem\n\n- {{gtClass:MyGtMcpReadPageTool}} only accepted `pageTitle` — no way to look up by ID. Passing `pageId` failed with \"Unknown arguments\".\n- {{gtClass:MyGtMcpAddSnippetTool}} and {{gtClass:MyGtMcpAddTableSnippetTool}} also only accept `pageTitle` — ambiguous when the same title exists in multiple databases.\n- {{gtClass:MyGtMcpListPagesTool}} outputs page UIDs in dashed UUID format (`ca2c3259-...`), but Lepiter's `pageWithID:` expects string36 (`46io0su0rvyxeisi76472568a`). Format mismatch caused lookup failures.\n- Database IDs used string36 in `gtPage` annotations (`db=`) but weren't exposed in MCP tools at all."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
