				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## Consistent Parameter Naming\n\nAll tools that reference Lepiter entities will use these parameter names and formats:\n\n- `pageId` (string36) — Page UUID, e.g. `46io0su0rvyxeisi76472568a`\n- `pageTitle` (string) — Page title, e.g. `\"Frida Project Notes\"`\n- `databaseId` (string36) — Database UUID, e.g. `60x6f5o0qd1whj3w3siacdymt`\n- `snippetUid` (base64 LeUID) — Snippet UID, e.g. `XkVHWo48RIagpu5LYcrnPw==` (unchanged, different entity type)"
			},
