				"string" : "### Step 1: Add shared helper — `MyGtMcpTool>>#findPageFrom:`\n\nDefine on base class {{gtClass:MyGtMcpTool}}. No tool calls it yet, so nothing breaks.\n\n**Logic:**\n1. If `databaseId` provided → find database by `uuidString =`, else use `defaultLogicalDatabase`\n2. If `pageId` provided → `UUID fromString36:`, iterate pages comparing `uid =`\n3. Else if `pageTitle` provided → `detect:` by title within scoped DB\n4. Else → error: \"Either pageId or pageTitle must be provided\"\n\n**Returns** the page or signals an error."
			},
