					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "### Step 2: Update `listPages` — {{gtClass:MyGtMcpListPagesTool}}\n\n**Schema changes:**\n- Add optional `databaseId` (string) — scope search to a specific database (string36)\n\n**Output format change:**\n- Page UID: `uid asString` → `uid asString36`\n- Each line becomes: `<pageId_string36> | <title> | <dbName> (<dbId_string36>)`\n\n**Why safe:** Output is consumed by LLMs as text, not parsed programmatically."
			},
