				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "### Step 3: Update `readPage` — {{gtClass:MyGtMcpReadPageTool}}\n\n**Schema changes:**\n- `pageId` (string, optional) — page UUID as string36 (was dashed UUID)\n- `pageTitle` (string, optional) — page title\n- `databaseId` (string, optional) — scope title lookup to a specific database (string36)\n- `required: []` (at least one of pageId or pageTitle must be provided)\n\n**Execute:** Use `findPageFrom:` helper. Output UID as string36, database as `name (string36)`.\n\n**Test immediately after this step** — `readPage` is the most-used Lepiter tool."
			},
