				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "### Step 4: Update `addSnippet` — {{gtClass:MyGtMcpAddSnippetTool}}\n\n**Schema changes:**\n- `pageTitle` (string, optional) — was required, becomes optional\n- `pageId` (string, optional) — page UUID as string36 (new)\n- `databaseId` (string, optional) — scope page lookup/creation (string36) (new)\n- `content` (string, required) — unchanged\n- `snippetType` (enum text|pharo, optional) — unchanged\n- `required: ['content']`\n\n**Execute:** Use `findPageFrom:` for existing page lookup. For page creation (when title not found and no `pageId`), if `databaseId` provided, create page in that specific database; otherwise use `defaultLogicalDatabase`."
			},
