				"string" : "### Step 5: Update `addTableSnippet` — {{gtClass:MyGtMcpAddTableSnippetTool}}\n\n**Schema changes:**\n- `pageTitle` (string, optional) — was required, becomes optional\n- `pageId` (string, optional) — page UUID as string36 (new)\n- `databaseId` (string, optional) — scope page lookup/creation (string36) (new)\n- `columns` (string, required) — unchanged\n- `rows` (string, required) — unchanged\n- `height` (integer, optional) — unchanged\n- `required: ['columns', 'rows']`\n\n**Execute:** Same page lookup/creation pattern as `addSnippet` using `findPageFrom:`."
