				"string" : "## Status: DONE (2026-04-05)\n\nAll 6 steps implemented and validated live. Summary of changes:\n\n**New shared helpers on {{gtClass:MyGtMcpTool}}:**\n- `findDatabaseFrom:` — resolves `databaseId` (string36) or returns default logical database\n- `findPageFrom:` — resolves page by `pageId` (string36) or `pageTitle`, scoped by optional `databaseId`. Returns page or nil.\n\n**Updated tools:**\n- {{gtMethod:MyGtMcpListPagesTool>>#executeWithArguments:}} — output uses string36 for page UIDs, includes database name + string36 ID per line. Added optional `databaseId` input to scope search.\n- {{gtMethod:MyGtMcpReadPageTool>>#executeWithArguments:}} — accepts `pageId` (string36), `pageTitle`, `databaseId`. Output UIDs in string36.\n- {{gtMethod:MyGtMcpAddSnippetTool>>#executeWithArguments:}} — accepts `pageId`, `databaseId` alongside `pageTitle`. Page creation respects `databaseId` scoping.\n- {{gtMethod:MyGtMcpAddTableSnippetTool>>#executeWithArguments:}} — same as addSnippet.\n- {{gtMethod:MyGtMcpReadSnippetTool>>#executeWithArguments:}} — output enriched with Page title and Database name + string36 ID. Input unchanged.\n\n**Unchanged:** {{gtClass:MyGtMcpUpdateSnippetTool}} (snippet UID lookup only, no page/DB reference needed)."
